  "scope": "One disposable kind cluster running Kubernetes v1.36.1, one Traefik Proxy Gateway API controller (chart 42.4.1; image v3.7.19 pinned by the GHCR manifest digest), one synthetic Python HTTP application, and one Gateway. Two dedicated host-loopback ports map to the fixture's NodePorts. The case first routes a fixed GET over plaintext HTTP with no TLS listener, then replaces that listener with HTTPS termination using a local CA-signed certificate, minimum TLS 1.2, and a small TLS 1.2 cipher allowlist. It probes trusted and untrusted CAs, the correct and incorrect client hostname, accepted TLS versions, the exact response marker, and unmatched host/path behavior. No internet target, public address, production resource, attack traffic, WAF, application authorization, cloud load balancer, or certificate issuer is involved.",
